### ============================================
### USER SERVICE ENDPOINTS
### ============================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@path = /api/v1/users
@id = 1
@referenceId = 1

### Create a user
### Request Body: UserDto
### Response: Created UserDto
POST {{baseUrl}}{{path}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Summer Sale",
  "discountType": "PERCENTAGE",
  "amount": 15.00,
  "appliesTo": "CATEGORY",
  "referenceId": 1,
  "startDate": "2024-07-01T00:00:00Z",
  "endDate": "2024-07-31T23:59:59Z",
  "isActive": true
}

### Get a user by ID
### Request Body: -
### Response: UserDto
GET {{baseUrl}}{{path}}/{id}
#Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Get all useres
### Request Body: -
### Response: List<UserDto>
GET {{baseUrl}}{{path}}/reference/{referenceId}
#Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Update an existing user
### Request Body: UserDto
### Response: Updated UserDto
PUT {{baseUrl}}{{path}}/{id}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Delete a user by ID
### Request Body: -
### Response: No content (204)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}{{path}}/{id}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
